{
  "format": "solstice-test-control-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "vector-eraser-intersection",
  "description": "Two brush strokes cross on a vector layer. With the Vector Eraser set to Up to Intersection, touching one of them near its start removes it from its start to the crossing; the rest of it and the other stroke stay, and undo returns it.",
